infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title RFC 9218 urgency ladder
  desc Priority: u=0..7 — lower number is more urgent, scheduled first
  order asc
  sequences
    - label u=0 — render-blocking HTML
      desc Most urgent; served before anything else
    - label u=1 — critical CSS
      desc Unblocks first paint
    - label u=3 — stylesheets
      desc Visual completeness
    - label u=5 — async scripts and fonts
      desc Deferrable behaviour and text
    - label u=7 — background prefetch
      desc Least urgent; sent last
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #6366f1 #14b8a6
